[
    {
        "content": "<p>Working with a student, we've hit a TC synthesis error in differential geometry I don't understand. It's related to the new <code>IsNormableSpace</code>class. Its synthesis works in an example when specifying the implicit argument <code>M</code>, but fails in the definition we want to write down.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">module</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Geometry</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Manifold</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Riemannian</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Geometry</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Manifold</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">VectorBundle</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Riemannian</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Analysis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Complex</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">UnitDisc</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Geometry</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Manifold</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SmoothEmbedding</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Complex</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Manifold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ContDiff</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bundle</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UnitDisc</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isOpen_range_unitDisc_coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsOpen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">range</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UnitDisc</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coe</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- skipped</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isOpenEmbedding_coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsOpenEmbedding</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UnitDisc</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">isEmbedding_coe</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isOpen_range_unitDisc_coe</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">notation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"𝓘𝔻\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">modelWithCornersSelf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℂ</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">noncomputable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ChartedSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℂ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isOpenEmbedding_coe</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">singletonChartedSpace</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsManifold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ω</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isOpenEmbedding_coe</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isManifold_singleton</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isSmoothEmbedding_coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsSmoothEmbedding</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ω</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UnitDisc</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- skipped for brevity</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">coe_mfderiv_injective</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝔻</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Injective</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mvfderiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UnitDisc</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">isSmoothEmbedding_coe</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isImmersion</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mfderiv_injective</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- info: instIsNormableSpace -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsNormableSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">TangentSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℂ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: failed to synthesize instance of type class</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  IsNormableSpace ℝ (TangentSpace 𝓘𝔻 p)</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">Hint: Type class instance resolution failures can be inspected with the `set_option trace.Meta.synthInstance true` command.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝔻</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">TangentSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">TangentSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">ContinuousLinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bilinearComp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">E''</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TangentSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝔻</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">F''</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TangentSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝔻</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">innerSL</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℂ</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mvfderiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UnitDisc</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mvfderiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UnitDisc</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>CC <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110050\">@Sébastien Gouëzel</span> because you wrote the class, and <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"111080\">@Floris van Doorn</span> in case you like to solve another small Lean puzzle.</p>",
