    {
        "content": "<p>Here's the relevant part of the <code>set_option trace.Meta.synthInstance true in</code> output</p>\n<p>[Meta.synthInstance] <span aria-label=\"cross mark\" class=\"emoji emoji-274c\" role=\"img\" title=\"cross mark\">:cross_mark:</span> IsNormableSpace ℝ (TangentSpace 𝓘𝔻 p) ▼<br>\n  [] <span aria-label=\"check\" class=\"emoji emoji-2705\" role=\"img\" title=\"check\">:check:</span> new goal IsNormableSpace ℝ (TangentSpace 𝓘𝔻 p) ▶<br>\n  [apply] <span aria-label=\"cross mark\" class=\"emoji emoji-274c\" role=\"img\" title=\"cross mark\">:cross_mark:</span> apply @instIsNormableSpaceTangentSpace to IsNormableSpace ℝ (TangentSpace 𝓘𝔻 p) ▼<br>\n    [tryResolve] <span aria-label=\"cross mark\" class=\"emoji emoji-274c\" role=\"img\" title=\"cross mark\">:cross_mark:</span> IsNormableSpace ℝ (TangentSpace 𝓘𝔻 p) ≟ IsNormableSpace ?m.153 (TangentSpace ?m.160 ?m.164) <br>\n  [apply] <span aria-label=\"cross mark\" class=\"emoji emoji-274c\" role=\"img\" title=\"cross mark\">:cross_mark:</span> apply @instIsNormableSpace to IsNormableSpace ℝ (TangentSpace 𝓘𝔻 p) ▼<br>\n    [tryResolve] <span aria-label=\"cross mark\" class=\"emoji emoji-274c\" role=\"img\" title=\"cross mark\">:cross_mark:</span> IsNormableSpace ℝ (TangentSpace 𝓘𝔻 p) ≟ IsNormableSpace ?m.153 ?m.154 ▶<br>\n  [] result &lt;not-available&gt;</p>",
