    {
        "content": "<p>The <code>#synth</code> is a different problem. In <code>foo</code>, you're failing to synthesize</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝔻</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsNormableSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">TangentSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝔻</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Specifying the implicit argument means that you're coercing <code>p</code>.</p>",
        "id": 634034680,
        "sender_full_name": "Floris van Doorn",
        "timestamp": 1792688196
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>If you provide </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">RiemannianBundle</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">TangentSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝓘𝔻</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">𝔻</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>you solve the type-class instance problem in <code>foo</code></p>",
